        "filing_date": "2026-06-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also develop and provide in-house trainings on topics relevant to our business such as AI Literacy.",
        "start_character": 43450,
        "end_character": 43552
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001951070-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001951070-26-000022-1f23cb96ccdc85ff",
        "accession_number": "0001951070-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-11",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We register with applicable governmental and trademark authorities a number of trademarks, service marks, logos and trade names in efforts to protect the brands that we use in connection with the operation of our businesses and the offering of our products and services.",
        "start_character": 50580,
        "end_character": 50850
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001951070-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001951070-26-000022-1f23cb96ccdc85ff",
        "accession_number": "0001951070-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We sell our Higher Education products through a small number of third-party distributors and retailers who we also utilize for digital fulfillment, and consolidation of these distributors and retailers would result in fewer, larger entities with increased bargaining power and the ability to demand terms that are less favorable to us.",
        "start_character": 34881,
        "end_character": 35216
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001951070-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001951070-26-000022-1f23cb96ccdc85ff",
        "accession_number": "0001951070-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-11",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "•Many of our customers participate in Title IV programs and, as a service provider to institutions that participate in Title IV programs, we are required to comply with certain regulations promulgated by the U.S.",
        "start_character": 29225,
        "end_character": 29437
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001951070-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001951070-26-000022-1f23cb96ccdc85ff",
        "accession_number": "0001951070-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Consistent with our education mission, we prioritize our employees’ growth and development as key elements of our human capital strategy.",
        "start_character": 43026,
        "end_character": 43163
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001951070-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001951070-26-000022-1f23cb96ccdc85ff",
        "accession_number": "0001951070-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Each year, we conduct a talent review and succession planning process to identify and develop key leaders, building a strong pipeline of successors for our critical leadership roles both today and in the future.",
        "start_character": 44563,
        "end_character": 44774
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001951070-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001951070-26-000022-1f23cb96ccdc85ff",
        "accession_number": "0001951070-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-11",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "However, we believe that we are well-equipped to offer learning solutions across the entire learning lifecycle, from K-12 to higher education and through professional learning.",
        "start_character": 38219,
        "end_character": 38395
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001951070-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001951070-26-000022-1f23cb96ccdc85ff",
        "accession_number": "0001951070-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, we provide a structured set of leadership development programs designed to support leaders at all stages of their careers.",
        "start_character": 43553,
        "end_character": 43688
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001951070-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001951070-26-000022-1f23cb96ccdc85ff",
        "accession_number": "0001951070-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Over the last decade, we have invested more than $2.0 billion in developing a suite of market-leading digital learning solutions.",
        "start_character": 986,
        "end_character": 1115
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001951070-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001951070-26-000022-1f23cb96ccdc85ff",
        "accession_number": "0001951070-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-11",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
